+  // Observation gap that restarts the far-timer. NC6: measured on the REAL clock (the scan runs every 2 s real; game
+  // time runs up to ~12x faster, so a game-time gap of 10 s was exceeded by every single scan and the 20 s far-timer
+  // never completed). 10 real seconds = 5 missed scans; independent of the game speed multiplier.
   static double GapSeconds() { return 10.0; }
